  "titleJa": "財布がない！",
  "description": "混雑した駅のコンコースで、女子学生がバッグの中を探しながら財布がないことに気づき、不安そうな表情をしている。友人が床を指さしており、少し離れたベンチの近くには落とした財布が見えている。背景では、駅員が大きなスーツケースを持った高齢者を案内し、別の男性はこぼしたコーヒーを慌てて拭いている。また、急いでいる少年が電車に間に合おうと走っており、掲示板を確認している旅行者もいる。",
  "category": "trouble",
  "timeLimit": 45,
  "imagePrompt": "A high-quality, detailed illustration designed for an IELTS or Eiken English speaking picture-description test. Show a busy modern Japanese train station concourse in a clear, colorful, realistic educational illustration style. The main event is in the foreground: a teenage schoolgirl wearing a school uniform looks worried and searches inside her shoulder bag because she cannot find her wallet. Her facial expression clearly shows anxiety and confusion. Her female friend stands beside her and points toward the floor. A small wallet is visible on the floor near a bench several meters behind them, creating a visual clue that the girl has dropped it. Include several clear background sub-stories. On the left, a station employee is politely helping an elderly traveler who is carrying a large suitcase and looking at a station map. On the right, a man has accidentally spilled a cup of coffee and is bending down to clean the floor with tissues while looking embarrassed. In the middle background, a young boy with a backpack is running quickly toward the train gates because he appears to be late. Near a large electronic departure board, two tourists are studying the information and discussing which platform to use. Include ticket gates, a bench, signs, luggage, a station map, a departure board, and several passengers. Make every action visually distinct and easy to describe. The composition should contain a clear foreground, middle ground, and background, with approximately 8 to 12 visible people. No speech bubbles, no captions, no brand logos, no copyrighted characters, no text that is necessary to understand the scene. Landscape 16:9 composition, detailed but uncluttered, suitable for English speaking assessment.",
